[h2]Build 0.9.13[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Miner power suit: a lightly armoured work suit that digs through rock much faster, yields a little more and carries more.
[*]Miner drill arm: a heavy rotary drill that speeds up mining (two drill arms faster still) and bores into anything that gets too close.
[*]Miner drill booster pack: three power cells and a capacitor coil that drive the drill arms harder for much faster digging. It drains the cells quickly while mining and needs a drill arm fitted.
[/list]
